# Read by Maven on every build, local and in CI, as if typed on the command line.
#
# Since 3.10, Maven asks each repository for a list of what it holds before using it.
# Flyway's parent POM adds two repositories that need a login, so both answer 401 and
# Maven prints a warning on every build. Nothing this project uses comes from them.
# These two lines stop Maven from asking those two for the list; every other
# repository still gets asked. A misspelled name here is ignored without an error, so
# the warning coming back is the sign that one of them stopped matching.
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.resolvePrefixFiles.flyway-community-db-support=false
-Daether.remoteRepositoryFilter.prefixes.resolvePrefixFiles.MavenFeed=false
